# ServiceNow Basics (Level 0)

- ServiceNow is a database with a web interface.
- Table = whole notebook. Record = one row. Field = one column.
- List = many records. Form = one record.
- Update set = recording of configuration changes. Only the current one records.
- Incident records are data, not configuration, so they are not in update sets.
- URLs: /incident_list.do opens a list, /incident.do opens a new form.
